    "rating": 5,
    "reference": "ChIJmdKEznB2Sk0Rp2fKQGW4ICc",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Roxanne",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112302391209735187495/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL9UsPL53vyQsRj4SwEdHygeBe8Celm4GVfNBfBIzLLUQJGyCw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Mancuso Transport was outstanding from start to finish. They arrived right on time, came fully prepared, and worked efficiently without cutting corners. Every step of the process was handled with professionalism and care, and it was clear they take real pride in their work. The team was friendly, respectful, and incredibly hardworking, making what could have been a stressful day completely smooth.\n\nA special shoutout to Tony — he went above and beyond to make sure everything was done perfectly. His leadership, attention to detail, and positive attitude really stood out. If you’re looking for a punctual, professional, and reliable moving company, look no further. Highly recommend!",
        "time": 1769387159,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "carlo",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113843832981341561388/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJQ9Xic9r0JqP_yD1s8A4aq0yGn341VOgAd1MRp1XbE2AjMIQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "It's tough to find a good place to start without rambling. Chris and his team are polite, efficient and maybe machines? They hardly took breaks and only ate during their travel. I really felt like my time and budget were valued by Manusco Transport and not at all like I was being taken advantage of. On both days of my move they worked tirelessly and until late at night.\n\nManusco Transport were a well oiled machine. During our move we realised we accumulated a ton of belongings over the years and Chris and his team made multiple trips to and from the house in order to meet our tight move deadlines. Chris and his team are helpful and good people. I recommend Manusco Transport to anyone looking for movers.\n\nThank you so much for the packing and moving guys, best of luck in your future endeavors!",
        "time": 1768864488,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carole Montpetit",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115939525235800426002/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJp56Tyyd_lMyeXdshDcMjR_DsYLVY7_nG27PwXe6fSoajaGg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "We had a great experience with MancusoTransport. Chris and his team arrived right on time and were professional from start to finish. They were very careful with our belongings, taking the time to wrap items securely and handle everything with care. They even put carpets down to make sure our floors didn’t get wet, which we really appreciated. The team was respectful, efficient, and clearly took pride in their work. highly recommend them to anyone looking for a reliable and thoughtful moving company.",
        "time": 1766274491,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "J K",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108035969781658945341/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKCsHImASfIgiC7vbJG3Ns_lbOcrW6Fs2eYTeYDeWVdJvTTXg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 weeks ago",
        "text": "We were recommended Manusco transport and are more than  satisfied with our experience. Chris and his teammates helped us pack our entire house, labelling boxes and wrapping all our fragile kitchen items. They were so efficient that we were able to start bringing boxes to the new house on day 1. Day 2 was mostly focused on furniture, the team was meticulous in disassembling beds, appliances, and moving it all to the new house. They were professional, attentive, and careful to bring boxes in the instructed rooms as they unloaded the truck. We will absolutely be recommending them to anyone asking us who to call for their moving needs. Thank you again to the whole team!",
        "time": 1768865464,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Gail",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109223280520378392237/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW_T9EmWOyrypFw4I_RhTaJ3KjicPdmPp4yMA2voXeZUld0UkjD=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 weeks ago",
        "text": "Mancuso struck the right note with my January move! Despite my initial worries about moving my piano, they proved to be the perfect maestros. Their care and expertise made the whole experience a symphony of success.",
        "time": 1769436226,
        "translated": false
      }
    ],
